From b7946eabab01221cc79dece1119ea8e301b7c3e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:04:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Settlements: the six critical NK calculation fixes

- Rentals: a credit (a Versorger refund marked for the NK, an amount typed
  with a minus) now lowers the tenant's costs instead of being charged.
- Rentals: an Abrechnung with its own shorter period now uses the costs,
  Vorauszahlungen, Grundsteuer and Hausgeld of that period, and a tenant who
  left before that period gets no line.
- Rentals: in the purchase year the tenant pays the yearly Grundsteuer for
  his days, not only the quarters due after the purchase.
- Casa Castel: the NK inside a Pauschale is counted day by day, so a
  'davon NK' change or a switch to Kalt + NK gives the right Kurzzeit share.
- Casa Castel: in a change month each tenant is credited the NK
  prepayment he really paid, not a split by days.
- Own NK (Dashboard): the costs follow the tenant's days when the tenant or
  the year is picked after the costs were typed.

Letters already sent keep the figures they went out with (Rentals letters
sent before this update, locked Casa years, sent own NK letters).

